---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
---

<Section variant="white" id="current-wedges" label="Solutions">
  <h2 class="text-h2 mb-md max-w-3xl">Any Industry, Any Infrastructure</h2>
  <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mb-lg">
    Build your stack to work and grow with your business. Don't see your use case? We have components that work across industries and can fit your needs.
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-lg">
    <article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-text/10 bg-texture-1 p-lg">
      <h3 class="text-h3 mb-xs">Operations Automation</h3>
      <p class="text-body text-muted mb-sm">
        Move repetitive workflows, reporting, approvals, document processing, and data movement into reliable systems.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/operations-automation"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs text-sm font-semibold text-brand hover:text-brand-700 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand rounded-sm transition-colors duration-fast"
      >
        Explore <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </article>

    <article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-text/10 bg-texture-1 p-lg">
      <h3 class="text-h3 mb-xs">Guava BI</h3>
      <p class="text-body text-muted mb-sm">
        Turn inventory data into trusted visibility, important signals, and clearer decisions.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/guava-bi"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs text-sm font-semibold text-brand hover:text-brand-700 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand rounded-sm transition-colors duration-fast"
      >
        Explore <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </article>
  </div>
</Section>